   "t": "mine, a terrible monster appeared - big\ntrouble--"
  },
  {
   "i": 1141,
   "src": "31985cff6bb9",
   "t": "I think something similar happened"
  },
  {
   "i": 1144,
   "src": "296b13482b32",
   "t": "in the mining accident decades ago."
  },
  {
   "i": 1151,
   "src": "1e52ed43bbf1",
   "t": "{{mio}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1160,
   "src": "c7107efd329b",
